names.tsv.gz: ScummVM game IDs, engines and full titles

Source: the game list a ScummVM release prints with `scummvm --list-games`
(https://www.scummvm.org), drawn from the detection tables in ScummVM's
engine sources. The ScummVM version is recorded on the first line of the
file. scripts/scummvmnames regenerates it from that list and is the
preferred form for modifying it.

Only the fields named above are taken.

ScummVM
